# Confii self-config snapshot artifacts (V-06 / G22).
#
# observe.VersionManager writes one JSON file per snapshot under the
# configured storage path. Test runs that exercise SaveVersion /
# EnableVersioning leave these files behind in the repo's default
# .confii/versions/ directory; ignoring the directory prevents future
# test runs from leaking artifacts into version control. Existing
# tracked snapshots predate this rule (commit 56554d5) and may be
# pruned in a follow-up; the ignore prevents new leaks regardless.
.confii/

# MkDocs build output
site/

# Override ambient developer-machine global ignores that match repo paths.
# Some developers' ~/.gitignore_global blocks **/secrets/ which would hide
# the examples/secrets/ directory we ship as a runnable example.
!examples/secrets/
!examples/secrets/**
